# Prod: SOCKS (as in torrc) PLUS the v3 .onion hidden service bridging onion:80 to the
# daemon. HiddenServiceDir matches the layout of the dperson/torproxy image this replaced,
# so an existing tor-data volume keeps its .onion address, keys, and authorized_clients
# (client auth) across the swap.
User tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
Log notice stdout
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hidden_service
HiddenServicePort 80 satori:8787
